  "_note": "4046-type CMOS phase-locked loop (CD4046B pinout). Engine (bw-board cd4046): VCO on the external R1 (pin 11), R2 (pin 12) and C1 (pins 6-7), f = (V(vco_in)/R1 + (VDD/2)/R2)/(2 C1 VDD); comparator I (XOR) on pin 2; comparator II (three-state phase-frequency detector) on pin 13 with pcp_out (pin 1) HIGH while it rests (locked); sig_in self-biased at half supply; dem_out follows vco_in; inh HIGH stops the VCO; zener pin not modelled. Reports vcoHz, edges, locked.",
